  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">First Somalia Economic Resilience Development Policy Financing</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The development objective of the First Somalia Economic Resilience Development Policy Financing for Somalia is to promote economic resilience through more sustainable public finances and resilient private sector development. Pillar A aims to ensure sustainable public finances. This will contribute to the macroeconomic stability and will expand fiscal space required to meet Somalia&apos;s large development needs in the context of high volatility to climate change and fragility, conflict, and violence. Pillar B aims to enable resilient private sector development. This pillar supports structural reforms that enhance the environment for private-sector-led growth and create conditions for job creation, increasing the resilience of households.</narrative>
  </description>
